{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-cues#feature-1","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-cues","commit":"9cafc3ad2e6b9d28ad6432d396f3e2eaeaa107e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-cues 的功能「回合与工具结果提示」：收到回合结束或工具结果事件时，插件按完成、错误、中断、受阻等状态排入相应提示音；用户可在设置页调整该条音效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:174-205","lib/client.js:377-385"]}
