{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-cues#feature-3","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-cues","commit":"9cafc3ad2e6b9d28ad6432d396f3e2eaeaa107e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-cues 的功能「自定义音频与逐条音量」：设置页支持上传音频并绑定到提示条目，也可调整每条音量；上传文件存入插件的 assets/custom/ 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:590-617","lib/client.js:1002-1040"]}
{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-cues#feature-4","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-cues","commit":"9cafc3ad2e6b9d28ad6432d396f3e2eaeaa107e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-cues 的功能「提示音设置与浮动提示条」：网页设置中可试听音效、切换总开关并配置提示条；客户端将设置页、通用快捷开关和右下角提示条接入 DSH 插槽。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1417-1478","lib/client.js:849-903"]}
{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-cues#caveat-1","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-cues","commit":"9cafc3ad2e6b9d28ad6432d396f3e2eaeaa107e0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-cues 使用前须知：默认的两首主题是 WebAudio 合成演奏，并非原版录音；如需播放自己的音频，可在设置页上传后绑定到对应提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:239-260","lib/client.js:357-370","README.md:139-152"]}
{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-cues#caveat-2","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-cues","commit":"9cafc3ad2e6b9d28ad6432d396f3e2eaeaa107e0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-cues 使用前须知：自定义音频写入插件目录的 assets/custom/，配置会同步写入插件目录的 state.json；目录只读时上传不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-41","lib/index.js:115-128","lib/index.js:590-617"]}
